---
/*
  Mount point for one future piece (a motion study or a small game).

  When a piece is added:
  - Keep it in its own module, for example src/experience/pieces/<name>.ts.
  - Load it only from src/pages/experience.astro, with dynamic import()
    or an Astro island that the shared layout never imports.
    Home and about must stay free of that code.
  - Start it only after this page is open.
  - Stop it when the visitor leaves (pagehide): cancel animation frames,
    disconnect observers, remove listeners, and release audio or a game loop.
  - Honor prefers-reduced-motion before starting motion.
  - One piece at a time. Unmount the current one before mounting the next.
*/
---

<div id="experience-mount" class="experience-slot" data-experience-slot></div>
